ts in the development of data-driven solutions.\n*   Collected and cleaned data from various sources.\n*   Created basic data visualizations using Excel.\n*   Assisted in the development of reports and dashboards.\n\n**Education**\n\n**Master of Science in Data Science | University of California, Berkeley | Berkeley, CA | 2018**\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Statistics | University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign | Urbana, IL | 2016**\n\n**Projects**\n\n*   **Customer Churn Prediction:** Developed a machine learning model to predict customer churn using Python and scikit-learn. Achieved 85% accuracy.\n*   **Sales Forecasting:** Created a forecasting model using time series analysis and regression techniques to predict future sales.\n\n**Awards & Recognition**\n\n*   Dean's List, University of California, Berkeley (2017-2018)\n*   Data Science Competition Winner, University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign (2016)\"\n\n\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -1.5037935972213745}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.000726316764485091}, {"token": "Mat", "logprob": -4.768360213347478e-06}, {"token": "thias", "logprob": -3.123234637314454e-05}, {"token": "▁Al", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "giers", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "**", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": "(", "logprob": -5.2927523938706145e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.5109500288963318}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "3", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "5", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "6", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "-", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "7", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "8", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "9", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "▁|", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁mat", "logprob": -4.1126360883936286e-05}, {"t